        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malahya ntaale, na shiinū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūmò wa bamalaika abo baalī na nzweso wiza, ūniwīla gīkī, “Nzūgū nakoolekeje ū nsango gokwe ū malahya ntaale, ūyo igashije higūlya ya minzī mingī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo batemi ba mu sī balikalaga bakwijingīlaga nang'hwe, pye na a bikaji ba mu sī walī wabaseeseeja mvinya ya būmalahya bokwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūnibūūcha mu mbika ya Kiimoyo, ūnitwala kwitogolo; nūkamona nkīma adamhīlile shiinū yaza yokalile mina ga būsondagūji; yalī na mitwe mpungatī na mapembe ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo walī azwalile shizwalo sha nzulunge na shaaza, hama hangī azwalīlile na būlenji bo zahabu na mawe ga mpango ntaale na luulu. Ū mu nkono gwakwe walī na shikombe sha zahabu shokalile mihayo ya malofu na būsoso bo būmalahya bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū būshū bokwe walī andīkilwe lina; gīkī, MBISĪLA, BABELI, NINA NTAALE WA BAMALAHYA, NA WA BŪSOSO BO MU SĪ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo nakamona walī aleebilwe mininga ga beela, na mininga ga bakaanīji ba ng'wa Yesu. Aho namona nūkumya na kakumīje kataale no! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū malaika ūniwīla, “Nibūlī ūlīkumya? Nakūkūwīla ī mbisīla ya nkīma ng'wenūyū nī ya shiinū īyo wīdamhīlaga, īyo īlī na mitwe mpungatī na mapembe ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiinū īyo wībonaga yalī īlīho ī kwandya, ī haha ītīho, alīyo īlī hihī kūpuluka kwīnga ū ng'wishimayenze īje mu kūyagala. A bikaji ba mu sī, abo mina gabo gatandīkilwe mu shitabo sha būpanga kūfuma ikanza lya kūseeng'wa kwa sī, bakūkumya ūlū bībona ī shiinū yenīyo, īyo yalīho, alīyo ī haha ītīho, hama hangī īlilonge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaha lyagongwa iganiko lya masala; ī mitwe īyo mpungatī jilī ngūlū mpungatī ījo ajigasīgije ū nkīma ng'wenūyo, a benabo batemi mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batanò bamala kūgwishiwa, ūmò ataalī alīho, lelo ū ūngī ataalī ū kwilonga, ūlū wilonga shiigelile ashinge ho kakanza kado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiinū īyo yalīho kwandya alīyo ī haha ītīho, ī yene ya kanaane, īlī mu lūkwa lūmò na a babo mpungatī, nayo ījile mu kūyagala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mapembe ikūmi ayo wagabonaga, a bene batemi ikūmi; gwike bataalī ū kwanukūla ū būsugi. Alīyo bakwanukūla būdūla bo kūsuga hamò nayo ī shiinū ikanza lya sa īmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A boi balaganile mhayo gūmò, gwa kūyinha būdūla na kwīguzuhya ī shiinū yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakwilwisha būlūgū nū Ng'wana wa Ng'holo; alīyo ū Ng'wana wa Ng'holo akūbapyena, nguno ū ng'wene alī Seeba wa baseeba na Ntemi wa batemi, nīyo abo balī nang'hwe balī basolwa na basanyiwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī ū malaika ūniwīla gīkī, “A minzī ayo wagabonaga agigasīgije ū malahya ng'wenūyo, a benabo banhū; būhī na būhī wa mahanga ga būlī ndīmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiinū īyo wībonaga yenīyo īkwīta īnkolwe ū malahya. Na a mapembe ayo ikūmi nago gakūnkolwa; hūna lūūlū bakūnkenaagūla banzuuje baneke buyīkī, nū mīlī gokwe bagūlye; hūna bampembeele na moto ashile ho gete! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Mulungu wabinhile ū mung'holò jabo iganiko līmò lya kūbūlekela shiinū ū būtemi wabo kūshisha īshikīīle ī mihayo yakwe gīt'ūmo ayīhelelile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ūyo wamonaga ng'wenūyo, h'ī līnzengo ī litaale īlo lībasugile a batemi ba mu sī!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
